cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Please cite this repository when using its code or data, and cite the
  accompanying research article when its bibliographic record is available.
  This citation describes the reproducibility package, not a separate paper.
type: software
title: Double parton scattering singularities in two-loop gluon-fusion amplitudes
authors:
  - family-names: Bhattacharya
    given-names: Arunima
repository-code: https://github.com/abhattacharya1992/two-loop-dps-prl
abstract: >-
  Reproducible code, retained numerical data and validation checks for
  leading two-loop double-parton-scattering logarithms and finite matching
  in scalar, pseudoscalar and massless-quark-loop vector-boson pair amplitudes.
keywords:
  - QCD
  - scattering amplitudes
  - double parton scattering
  - reproducibility
